    <p>Online classes and one-on-one sessions are available at flexible times. Please enquire to arrange a time that works for you.</p>

    <div class="announcement-box reveal" style="text-align:left;">
      <h3 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;font-size:1.2em;color:#2E5A6B;margin-bottom:0.5em;">Online Courses</h3>
      <p>Full details of all online programmes - including Qigong, Qigong Teacher Training, Yoga Teacher Training and Yin Yoga - are available on the dedicated <a href="/online-courses/">Online Courses</a> page.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="shared-story reveal">
      <p><strong>Jenny offers online:</strong> 200-hour and 500-hour Yoga Teacher Training courses with Restorative Yoga as a core element. She also offers Therapeutic Yoga, Restorative Yoga, Vinyasa Yoga, Hatha Yoga, Yin Yoga and other related classes.</p>
<p><strong>Seb offers online:</strong> Qigong ranging from absolute beginner forms to highly precise advanced Shen practices, private one-on-one Qigong sessions with specific applications, Qigong training courses, and 200-hour Qigong Teacher Training courses. These programmes draw on knowledge and skills that are rarely taught in mainstream settings and often not explored by other teachers at all - material that goes well beyond what is typically available in this space.</p>
</div>

    <p>To book an online session, please get in touch through any of the channels on our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p>
